{"id":"e_clair","lemma":"éclair","pos":"noun","rank":3252,"glosses":["lightning bolt","flash","sparkle"],"ipa":"/e.klɛʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/02/Fr-%C3%A9clair.ogg/Fr-%C3%A9clair.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"éclairs"},"formAudio":{"éclairs":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/60/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-DenisdeShawi-%C3%A9clairs.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Les éclairs peuvent être dangereux.","en":"Lightning can be dangerous.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"dangerous"}]},{"text":"C'est arrivé en un éclair.","en":"It happened in a flash.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"to arrive","l":"arriver"},{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Il l'a fini en un éclair.","en":"He finished it as quick as lightning.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to finish","l":"finir"},{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Ça a été un éclair de génie.","en":"It was a stroke of genius.","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"genie"}],"phrases":[[0,3,"was everything OK?"]]},{"text":"Il y a du tonnerre et des éclairs.","en":"There's thunder and lightning.","words":[null,null,null,null,null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null],"phrases":[[0,3,"ago"],[3,5,"extremely well"]]}]}